{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa and The Rude Customer"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "You Should Try This Instead!"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Food for Thought > Folklore on Food"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 5}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations"}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le05ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Offering Advice and Solutions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you work in a restaurant or in a shop, it is important to offer advice and solutions properly.<br><br>Remember to offer advice politely and to use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could<span>,   <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or  <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to propose a solution."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here is a list of expressions you can use to offer advice and solutions:<br/><br/><ul><li>You might want to \u2026</li> <li>Would you mind \u2026 ?</li> <li>You should</li> <li>You ought to ...</li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Offering Advice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding Politely\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>You might want to \u2026</li> <li>Would you mind ... ?</li> <li>You should</li> <li>You ought to ... (strong request)</li> <li> ... don't you think?</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>I understand, but ...</li> <li>I'm afraid not</li> <li>I apologize, but ... </li> <li>Here's what I think you could do</li> <li>That sounds reasonable</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: I had to deal with a rude customer yesterday. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: You ought to talk to your staff about this kind of situation, don't you think? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: That sounds reasonable. Thanks for the advice!"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Describing Behavior and Personality"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use adjectives and expressions to describe a person's personality and behavior."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You describe personality when you say how a person usually is. It is true most of the time. You use the verb <span class=\"strong\">to be</span> + adjectives.<br/>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You describe behavior when you say what a person does or how a person is at a particular time. You use the verb <span class=\"strong\">to be</span> + adjectives or expressions like <span class=\"italic\">you were acting ... </span> or <span class=\"italic\">you behaved</span> + adverb."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjectives of Personality\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Expressions of Behavior\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"calm<br> patient<br> rude<br> arrogant<br> relaxed<br> obnoxious\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You're acting ... <br> You're ... today<br> You were ... yesterday<br> I/you/he behaved ...  + adverb\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: You're acting all weird. What's wrong? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: I had to deal with an arrogant customer yesterday. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Keep calm! You're usually very patient."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to act weird "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to behave in a way that is not usual "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What's wrong? You are acting weird today."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob03aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about personality and behavior."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "arrogant "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "assuming to be superior; self-important "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Dealing with arrogant customers is very hard."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob03aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "You shouldn't let it get to you"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "Don't be upset about it"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You shouldn't let arrogant customers get to you."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob03aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "kindly "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in a kind and polite way"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We kindly request our customers to turn their phones off."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob03aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "obnoxious "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "extremely unpleasant "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The client was obnoxious and behaved badly."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob03aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "silent mode"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a setting on electronic devices that disables ringtones and alarms "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Please put your phones on silent mode."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob03aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "foyer "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the entrance area of a restaurant or hotel "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Please take urgent calls in the foyer."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob03aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "reasonable "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "fair and sensible"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Thanks for the advice. It sounds reasonable."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob03aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "conflict resolution "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a way to find a peaceful solution to a disagreement "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Conflict resolution is my speciality!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob03aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose a famous person. They could be an actor, an athlete, or a celebrity."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Go online and get information on their personality. How do you describe them?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short paragraph  (10-12 lines) "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraph to your partner. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I describe personality and behavior."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I look for information online."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a presentation about a famous person."}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "img_