 you could do. Why don't you put a sign at the entrance? Something that says \u201cWe kindly request that you keep your phones on silent mode and that you take urgent calls in the foyer\u201d. You also ought to talk to your staff about how to handle this kind of situations.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hmm ... that sounds reasonable. Thanks for the advice! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: No problem. Conflict resolution is my speciality!", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar"}]}